@base = http://localhost:3000/api/internships

### List (page 1, 3 per page)
GET {{base}}?page=1&limit=3

### Filter by domain and mode
GET {{base}}?domain=Full Stack Development&mode=Remote

### Search
GET {{base}}?q=sql

### Detail
GET {{base}}/INT-102

### Detail (not found -> 404)
GET {{base}}/INT-999

### Create
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "QA Intern",
  "domain": "Quality Assurance",
  "mode": "Remote",
  "skills": ["Testing"],
  "openings": 2
}

### Create with invalid data (-> 400)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A",
  "mode": "Moon",
  "openings": -1
}

### Update (change INT-106 to the id you created)
PUT {{base}}/INT-106
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "QA Intern",
  "domain": "Quality Assurance",
  "mode": "Hybrid",
  "openings": 4
}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/INT-106
